//! reached through parallel `keys`/`ids` arrays — see `name_lookup` for
//! why this is data and not a `match`.
//!
//! Zones are grouped by tzdb area and gated on `tz-names-<area>`; an area
//! that is not compiled in resolves to `None` throughout, and the caller
//! falls back to the localized GMT offset.

